#############################################
# episodes-fr-26-50.ttl -- batch #2, 2026-09-12.
# Frankly episodes numbered 26 through 50.
#
# Only 2 of 25 numbers already built (44, 47); 23 real, confirmed
# gaps minted as genuine minimal stubs -- the sparsest batch so far.
#
# Real, direct new find: Franklys 37/39/40/41 are a genuine, connected
# 4-part "Just Stop Oil" series (confirmed directly by their own real
# titles: Part 1 Gasoline, Part 2 Oil is the Economy, Part 3 10
# Pathways to Post-Growth, Part 4 The Intersection) -- minted as
# tgs:Series.JustStopOil below, even though all four parts are
# currently stubs rather than full builds. The series relationship
# itself is a real, structural fact confirmed by the titles,
# independent of whether the individual episodes have been built out
# yet -- matching the precedent of documenting a series before every
# member is fully populated.
#
# No other Series relevance in this range. Sorted by episode number.
# episodes.ttl itself is left untouched.
#############################################

<http://example.org/tgs#> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <http://example.org/thinkr#> ;
