        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_40_JustStopOilPart310PathwaysToPostGrowth,
        tgs:Monologue.Frankly_41_JustStopOilPart4TheIntersection ;
    skos:prefLabel "Just Stop Oil (4-part Frankly series)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Real, direct 4-part real series confirmed by title alone (2026-09-12) -- Frankly-37 through Frankly-41 (skipping Frankly-38, a real, unrelated Frankly in between), each explicitly numbered 'Part N' in its own real title. All four parts are currently minimal stubs, not yet fully built -- the series relationship is documented ahead of the content itself, since it's a structural fact independent of build status."@en ;
